    <statement><p>If <m>f(x)=x^{2} +8</m>, find and simplify the following:</p>
<p><alert>(a)</alert> <m>f(t+4) =</m> <fillin characters="50" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
<p><alert>(b)</alert> <m>f(t^2+4) =</m> <fillin characters="50" name="AnSwEr0002"/></p>
<p><alert>(c)</alert> <m>f(2) =</m> <fillin characters="50" name="AnSwEr0003"/></p>
<p><alert>(d)</alert> <m>2 f(t) =</m> <fillin characters="50" name="AnSwEr0004"/></p>
<p><alert>(e)</alert> <m>(f(t))^2+4 =</m> <fillin characters="50" name="AnSwEr0005"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>t^{2}+8t+24</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>t^{4}+8t^{2}+24</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>12</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>2t^{2}+16</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>t^{4}+16t^{2}+68</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><alert>(a)</alert>
<m>f(t+4) = (t+4)^2+8 = t^2+2 (4 t)+4^2+8 = t^2+8 t+24</m>



<alert>(b)</alert> 
<m>f(t^2+4) = (t^2+4)^2+8 = t^{2 (2)}+2 (4 t^{2})+4^2+8 =
    t^{4}+8 t^{2}+24</m>



<alert>(c)</alert> <m>f(2) = (2)^2+8 = 4+8 = 12</m>



<alert>(d)</alert> <m>2 f(t) = 2 (t^2+8)  = 2 t^2+16</m>



<alert>(e)</alert> 
<m>f(t)^{2}+4 = (t^2+8)^2+4 = t^4+2 (8 t^2) + 8^2+4 =
    t^4+16 t^2+68</m>.



</solution>
